{"id":"4c849eff8e22e2c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-cor-leray-hirsch.md","title":"Leray–Hirsch Theorem","display":"cor-leray-hirsch — Leray–Hirsch Theorem","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-leray-hirsch","aliases":["58-cor-leray-hirsch"],"display":"cor-leray-hirsch — Leray–Hirsch Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-bundle.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-leray-hirsch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-leray-hirsch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-leray-hirsch — Leray–Hirsch Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" href=\"?note=e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md\">../batch18/58-df-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03f2d34d9851bee4\" href=\"?note=03f2d34d9851bee4\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md\">../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md\">../batch04/58-df-tensor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ee7eb19b6f00f19\" href=\"?note=9ee7eb19b6f00f19\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7b6b88ff367ba588\" href=\"?note=7b6b88ff367ba588\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,B,F,R,\\tau_E,\\tau_B,\\tau_F\\in V\">\\(E,B,F,R,\\tau_E,\\tau_B,\\tau_F\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*(-;R):V\\to V\">\\(H^*(-;R):V\\to V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes_R:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\otimes_R:V^2\\to V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2FreeModule}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2FreeModule}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9ee7eb19b6f00f19\" href=\"?note=9ee7eb19b6f00f19\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" href=\"?note=e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md\">../batch18/58-df-bundle.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Basis}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Basis}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (local module specialization defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_b^*:H^*(E;R)\\to H^*(F;R)\">\\(i_b^*:H^*(E;R)\\to H^*(F;R)\\)</span> is the cohomological restriction induced by the fibre inclusion over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_R\">\\(\\cong_R\\)</span> denotes isomorphism of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-modules (using <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\">\\(+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\)</span> 固定为系数环 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的运算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_F,0_F,\\odot_F\">\\(+_F,0_F,\\odot_F\\)</span> 固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^*(F;R)\">\\(H^*(F;R)\\)</span> 的上同调模运算，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes_R\">\\(\\otimes_R\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_b^*\">\\(i_b^*\\)</span> 使用同一系数结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>这里的三元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Basis}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Basis}_S\\)</span> 为下式给出的模基专门化，不调用 dimension 文件中的二元向量空间基谓词。保留原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S\\)</span> 的参数与自由模载体约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7b6b88ff367ba588\" href=\"?note=7b6b88ff367ba588\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-algebra2-module-basis.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hirsch\\text{-}module\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Basis}_S(B_0,H^*(F;R),R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S(B_0;H^*(F;R),R,+_F,0_F,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hirsch\\text{-}module\\text{-}basis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Basis}_S(B_0,H^*(F;R),R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ModuleBasis}_S(B_0;H^*(F;R),R,+_F,0_F,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hirsch\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2FreeModule}_S(H^*(F;R),R,I)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H^*(E;R))\n\\land \\forall b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\{i_b^*(e(j)):j\\in I\\},H^*(F;R),R)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hirsch\\text{-}hypothesis}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F,R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F)\n\\land \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2FreeModule}_S(H^*(F;R),R,I)\n\\land \\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H^*(E;R))\n\\land \\forall b\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Basis}_S(\\{i_b^*(e(j)):j\\in I\\},H^*(F;R),R)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hirsch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F,R)\n\\to H^*(E;R)\\cong_R H^*(B;R)\\otimes_R H^*(F;R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}leray\\text{-}hirsch}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LerayHirsch}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,B,\\tau_B,F,\\tau_F,R)\n\\to H^*(E;R)\\cong_R H^*(B;R)\\otimes_R H^*(F;R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hypothesis is the existence of global cohomology classes whose restrictions form a basis on every fibre; it is not a transgression hypothesis.</li>\n<li>The explicit topology parameters make the invocation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Bundle}_S\\)</span> agree with its seven-place signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"e1e5dca961f5c9ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"03f2d34d9851bee4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-cohomology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee7eb19b6f00f19","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-algebra2-free-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"